lass=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula%20Egg\"><img alt=\"Tarantula Egg\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tarantula_Egg_6c32cf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Map meriana\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"115\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Map_meriana_a0c87e.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.8<br/>August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Meriana</b> is a small island north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Vandura\">Vandura</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Shattered%20Isles\">Shattered Isles</a>. A small group of rebels have created the settlement of <a href=\"#/wiki/Sabrehaven\">Sabrehaven</a> here to escape the oppression of the Thaian guard in <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>.\n</p><p>There is a steep mountain range along the southern coast, which serves as a disguise to prevent detection by the Thaian Guard that has occupied <a href=\"#/wiki/Vandura\">Vandura</a>. Left to themselves, the small rebel group are generally undisturbed by the officials of <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>.\n</p><p>The island itself is fairly safe, with only small frogs, crabs and wasps and the occasional centipede found wandering on the beaches and in the palm trees. There are spiders and tarantulas in the mountain as well as a tiger.\n</p><p>On this island you can find the <a href=\"#/wiki/Meriana%20Gargoyle%20Cave\">Meriana Gargoyle Cave</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32389,32604,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32389, 32604, 7)</a>, a large cave that features <a href=\"#/wiki/Gargoyle\">Gargoyles</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula\">Tarantulas</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golems</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Crab\">Blood Crabs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Thornback%20Tortoise\">Thornback Tortoises</a>\n</p><p>This island can be accessed via the Access to Meriana quest.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Meriana NPCs (8 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ariella\">Ariella</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ariella\"><img alt=\"Ariella\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ariella_bcee3d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Rebel</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\"